  "question": {
    "text": "The slopes of the tangents to the curve <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> at the points where it cuts the <math><mi>x</mi></math>-axis, are <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>,&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
